        <atom:updated>2026-09-07T15:29:05-05:00</atom:updated>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>hold each-<br />
other<br />
close<br />
and carry a<br />
knife</p>
<p>keep your eyes open<br />
keep the edge true</p>
<p>aim for<br />
the heart<br />
in both cases</p>
<p><em>Originally published in 'Twenty Poems Written in November 2024, or Me, You, &amp; The World, What Are We To Do?'. Download the whole collection <a href="/files/MYaTWWITBD.pdf">here</a>.</em></p>]]></description>
        
